Dialogue: 100,1:45:19.40,1:45:24.45,Karaoke (Right; Hieroglyphs),,0,0,0,,涙さえも味方に
Dialogue: 100,1:45:19.40,1:45:24.45,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150, 150)}Ngay cả nước mắt cũng trở thành tri kỷ.
